OL,3,GNEWSAExpert health team appointed to
OL,4,Aoversee NHS Grampian improvements
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngela Constance makes a ministerial
OL,7,Fstatement on NHS Grampian in light of a
OL,8,Fdamning report on its leadership
OL,10,FShe told Holyrood an "external
OL,11,Fintervention support team", comprising
OL,12,Fexperienced senior NHS leaders, will
OL,13,Fwork alongside Grampian's health team
OL,14,Fto provide "intensive turnaround
OL,15,Fsupport"
OL,17,FAhead of that statement, backbench MSPs
OL,18,Fquestioned the First Minister on issues
OL,19,Fconcerning their constituents
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
